  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SIM - Carrd</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented in Philippines. The main outcome areas it contributes to are Democracy and Human Rights, Just Transition/Climate Change, Peace and Dialogue and Gender Equality. The main rights holders are women and girls groups, Out of School Youth, Farmers and Indigenous People. Through organising people in community-based organisations to be able to help themselves, exercise their rights, make claims to their governments both at the local and national levels and negotiate for mutually agreeable responses to their situation of poverty. By awareness raising, capacity building of organisations and policy advocacy organising, the project aims to achieve progressive development within the outcome areas.</narrative>
  </description>
